  shortStory: "The Manananggal (\"self-segmenter\") is a Filipino Aswang (evil spirit)
    that detaches her torso from her lower half and then takes flight during the
    night to eat infants.\r\n\r\nThis creature's name was derived from the Filipino
    word, \"tanggal,\" which means \"to separate\" because of the manananggal's ability
    to separate itself from its lower body.\r"
